  "bun": {
    "why": "Bun 1.4.2 doesn't format .each titles: %s, %p, %j and $name stay as written, in its console output as well as its report. Bun misreads tagged-template .each tables: it runs more rows than written, with undefined values, so an assertion comparing two cells compares undefined with undefined and passes. When a file uses .only, Bun leaves every test it doesn't run out of its report, where Jest reports them as skipped.",
